Subject: [PATCH 2/2] dolby: Patch soundfx for Xiaomi prebuilt AIDL ABI and
 import dada ODM dax-default

---
 dolby.mk                                      |   10 +-
 .../etc/dolby/dax-default-spatializer.xml     | 1449 +++++++++--------
 proprietary/vendor/etc/dolby/dax-default.xml  |  462 +++++-
 .../vendor/lib64/soundfx/libdlbvolaidl.so     |  Bin 464168 -> 602681 bytes
 .../vendor/lib64/soundfx/libhwdapaidl.so      |  Bin 597688 -> 810249 bytes
